        "created_at": "2016-07-09T20:19:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That's good enough I suppose.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>GTG really is amazing, not only do they make amazing games, but they constantly reteach me that I must be patient  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=9\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>(Seriously, with how awesome they are I still tend to forget how few people are involved and how many balls they have in the air. )</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
